# Commits in agent-projects

**Policy:** Use the global Cursor **User** rule (`~/tech/AI/cursor/user-rules/git-commits.mdc`).

**Enforcement:** Global git hooks (`~/.githooks`).

```bash
~/tech/AI/cursor/git-hooks/install.sh
```

Wrapper in this repo: `./scripts/install-global-git-hooks.sh` (calls the same install).

Do not set a repo-local `core.hooksPath` unless you intentionally override global hooks.
